    "detailed_description": "A peaceful asteroid is soaring through space when suddenly-- <i>BOOM!</i> A mysterious force smashes the asteroid and leaves its debris falling towards a nearby planet's surface! Out of the rubble jumps Gumdrop, who must now venture out and collect all the star pieces that burst out after the crash.<br><br><i>Stardrop</i> is a 3D platformer collectathon game where you play as Gumdrop: a strange, little creature whose goal is to collect all the star pieces that fell out of their asteroid after being smashed in orbit. Make your way through a whimsical world on a quest to collect every last drop! Every last... Star... drop... eh? get it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/a333a7a04930c2025fa0a16022df9ed6.poster.avif?t=1726019364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/a333a7a04930c2025fa0a16022df9ed6.webm?t=1726019364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/a333a7a04930c2025fa0a16022df9ed6.mp4?t=1726019364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Little Blob On A Little Mission</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/5c72dfe4e2b261f3e8e39d0d4e2753cd.avif?t=1726019364\" width=640 height=150 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sweet, expressive movement! Run, jump, dash, spring, and leap through enemies and obstacles.<br></li><li>Expansive, open world! Choose whichever direction you'd like! The world may even open up more the further you progress.<br></li><li>Whimsical, colorful characters! Meet a multitude of new faces on your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/d1ff5f4cdc98dfa59f41f35a8e7591a2.poster.avif?t=1726019364\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/d1ff5f4cdc98dfa59f41f35a8e7591a2.webm?t=1726019364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976700/extras/d1ff5f4cdc98dfa59f41f35a8e7591a2.mp4?t=1726019364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
